### Arquivo para testar a API
### Use a extensão REST Client do VSCode

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = SEU_TOKEN_AQUI

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Registrar novo usuário
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "João",
  "last_name": "Silva",
  "email": "joao@email.com",
  "senha": "SenhaForte123",
  "date_of_birth": "1990-01-15"
}

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "joao@email.com",
  "senha": "SenhaForte123"
}

### Obter dados do usuário autenticado (requer token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Verificar se email existe
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/check-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "joao@email.com"
}

### Teste de validação - Email inválido
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "email-invalido",
  "senha": "SenhaForte123"
}

### Teste de validação - Senha fraca
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria",
  "last_name": "Santos",
  "email": "maria@email.com",
  "senha": "123"
}

